WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A fictional regulated-workflow rehearsal. Execute regulated work through valid, evidenced states.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Attach an invented rule to each modeled state.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Require fixture evidence before transition.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Simulate approvals and deadlines.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Refuse invalid synthetic handoffs.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Not compliance, legal, or regulatory proof.
